{{fi-pronunciation|*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|intransitive}} To [[mourn]], [[grieve]] (''very often because of someone's death'').
# {{lb|fi|transitive}} To [[mourn]], [[grieve]] (over someone = ''[[partitive]]; over a dead person'').

